            "review_text": "jalekoob\nCopenhagen, Denmark40 contributions\n0\nGreat restaurant for hotpots\nDec 2017 • Couples\nThis restaurant is called Food Street and this is not a regular site for street food in Hanoi which the other reviews indicate. \n\nThe restaurant is specialized in hotpots where you decide what to put in the pot. We had chicken, corn, mushrooms and shrimps and it was very tasty and reasonable prized (200K Dong) and enough for two people. \n\nThe restaurant is placed close to a busy and noisy road which adds to the impression of authentic street food.\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2017",
